r/id #uuid "9048ec7c-7379-5c70-8f28-63dbf0d93b79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723155} {:answer/id #uuid "99b241f9-5048-5f67-a443-556dd478f593" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723158}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723158} :answer-field/id #uuid "e9c632fa-7f72-5332-b369-821bd5cc1845" :answer-field/key "$(2,7)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723191}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "200f141f-79ba-5717-af13-df25d6fa6586" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $2 x^{2} - 2 x y + 4 x + y^{2} - 2 y + 2=25$ is a tangent vector perpendicular to $\\mathbf v=\\langle 7,-3\\rangle$?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Set $F(x,y)=2 x^{2} - 2 x y + 4 x + y^{2} - 2 y + 2$, so the curve is $F(x,y)=25$. A tangent vector is $\\mathbf t=\\langle F_y,-F_x\\rangle$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_x&=4 x - 2 y + 4\\\\\nF_y&=- 2 x + 2 y - 2\\\\\n\\mathbf t(x,y)&=\\langle - 2 x + 2 y - 2,- 4 x + 2 y - 4\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nPerpendicularity requires\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle&=0\\\\\n- 2 x + 8 y - 2&=0\\\\\n- 2 (x - 4 y + 1)&=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe condition gives $y=\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{1}{4}$. Substitution into the original curve gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{25 x^{2}}{16} + \\frac{25 x}{8} + \\frac{25}{16}&=25\\\\\n\\frac{25 (x - 3) (x + 5)}{16}&=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence $x=-5$ or $x=3$. Recovering the other coordinate gives $(-5,-1)$ and $(3,1)$.\n\nThus the qualifying points are $(3,1)$ and $(-5,-1)$. All listed points lie on the curve. The following nonzero tangent vectors check every choice:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf t(4,5)&=\\langle 0,-10\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=30\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-6,-5)&=\\langle 0,10\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=-30\\\\\n\\mathbf t(2,7)&=\\langle 8,2\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=50\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-4,-7)&=\\langle -8,-2\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=-50\\\\\n\\mathbf t(3,1)&=\\langle -6,-14\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=0\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-5,-1)&=\\langle 6,14\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 7,-3\\rangle=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c397864e-4936-587e-860a-1bcefe039d07" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723177} {:answer/id #uuid "c6616f8e-b72b-5a0d-b76c-fb3f31450a78" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723179}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723179} :answer-field/id #uuid "26b6784a-2c08-5af5-b482-89f9fda070e0" :answer-field/key "$(-4,-3)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723117} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01e49656-db75-5c44-a03e-548322a1f04f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723102} {:answer/id #uuid "01eb7e49-1510-542e-8900-1fbac8650ebd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723103}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723103} :answer-field/id #uuid "9db87ae4-ddaa-50dd-bcc5-c7e571716e2f" :answer-field/key "$(4,-7)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723161} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "404ad5b3-3797-5695-8d45-ce735f66e02a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723129} {:answer/id #uuid "9a7063ff-066d-5afa-bd5c-42b439b6abdc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723160}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #