\\\n(x - 5) (x + 5)&=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence $x=-5$ or $x=5$. Recovering the other coordinate gives $(-5,2)$ and $(5,2)$.\n\nThus the qualifying points are $(5,2)$ and $(-5,2)$. All listed points lie on the curve. The following nonzero tangent vectors check every choice:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf t(5,2)&=\\langle 0,-10\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=0\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-5,2)&=\\langle 0,10\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=0\\\\\n\\mathbf t(3,6)&=\\langle 8,-6\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=8\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-3,-2)&=\\langle -8,6\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=-8\\\\\n\\mathbf t(4,-1)&=\\langle -6,-8\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=-6\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-4,5)&=\\langle 6,8\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle 1,0\\rangle=6\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723173 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2844d3c3-2d67-5b51-ab8b-2ac457967fdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723118} {:answer/id #uuid "c8d5cd81-2c04-512d-b695-68110bd05e30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723180}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723118} :answer-field/id #uuid "387d2691-32be-5ac2-a413-cf5666a49a5a" :answer-field/key "$(1,2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723125} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "48709eeb-af3b-5e28-b26e-04cee73235a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723133} {:answer/id #uuid "a02b4a5d-1573-5080-8215-18b7d9e29c89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186723164}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186723164} :answer-field/id #uuid "6447483c-c113-591a-8969-5d260ebd8d43" :answer-field/key "$(7,-2)$" :answer-f